Tools: the NEO-Cine library's core/ tools, which are Lemo-Opuscar's (MIT, (c) 2026 LemoLab): headless Chrome frame
capture, ffmpeg encode and loudness master; neo/geo/gtfs.py, neo/geo/osm.py, neo/audio/cues.py, neo/audio/master.py.

Form reference (grammar only, no sheet, layout or lettering copied): railway time-distance diagrams (German
Bildfahrplan, Chinese 列车运行图 with the ten-minute grid, the 19th-century Paris-Lyon graph), and railway strip maps.
